<translate>
==== OBSOLETE ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates that the item is obsolete. Removes the item from rendering on the ground and from other uses.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
OBSOLETE = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

